  "scope": "Standard UART (2 HP controllers), HP I2C (1 controller), standard SPI master (GPSPI2 only; SPI0/SPI1 drive the flash/PSRAM and are not exposed), LEDC channels (6 channels, low-speed only), ADC1 (single 6-channel unit, no ADC2), RMT channels and I2S master only. LP controllers (LP UART / LP I2C) are excluded. usb0 models the fixed USB Serial/JTAG pads (D- = GPIO13, D+ = GPIO14); the D+/D- pair must be routed together. The ESP32-C5 has no USB OTG, no SDMMC host and no ADC2, and TWAI is not enableable in ESP-IDF v5.4, so none of those are modelled. RMT channels 0-1 are TX-only and 2-3 are RX-only.",
  "peripherals": [
